chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Flow control for an advanced course: chapter 2 of the 3rd edition and today's Python"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-09-24T21:19:31; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4. Added in 1.1.0: sources P11 to P22, and a re-reading of P01 to P10, each opened and its text read on 2026-10-01 (times on each source), read for the definitions of the terms the chapter text used without defining them; every code claim of the corpus is now executed under Python 3.14.4 and 3.12.11." ;
